LEVEL 2 STAGING    : 02 Transform -&gt; stg_manufaktur + data/staging/*.csv
LEVEL 3 INTEGRATED : 03a/03b -&gt; dim_wilayah, fact_manufaktur, etl_changes, views vw_*
Database: pentaho/data/manufaktur_pentaho.sqlite</note>
